    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter <i>Hellmarch</i>, a world consumed by nightmares, ancient ruins, forbidden magic, and mountains of loot. Battle relentless enemy hordes, grow stronger with every run, and uncover the dark secrets of a forgotten land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Salvage gear into crafting materials and upgrade your loadout with unique recipes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AAA visuals powered by Unity Engine 6 \u2014 dark, detailed, and D4-inspired.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Massive enemy cap: now supports up to <strong>8192</strong> foes (doubled from <i>Malignant Survivors 1</i>).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore <strong>10+ diverse maps</strong>, each with its own deadly challenges.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter <i>Hellmarch</i>, a world consumed by nightmares, ancient ruins, forbidden magic, and mountains of loot. Battle relentless enemy hordes, grow stronger with every run, and uncover the dark secrets of a forgotten land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Salvage gear into crafting materials and upgrade your loadout with unique recipes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AAA visuals powered by Unity Engine 6 \u2014 dark, detailed, and D4-inspired.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Massive enemy cap: now supports up to <strong>8192</strong> foes (doubled from <i>Malignant Survivors 1</i>).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore <strong>10+ diverse maps</strong>, each with its own deadly challenges.</p></li></ul>",
